 drivers/phy/realtek/Kconfig           |   18 +-
 drivers/phy/realtek/Makefile          |    1 
 drivers/phy/realtek/phy-rtl819x-usb.c |  391 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 414 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create drivers/phy/realtek/phy-rtl819x-usb.c

