+	default MACH_REALTEK_RTL819X
+	help
+	  Enable this to support the two UTMI USB 2.0 PHYs found in the
+	  Realtek RTL819x router SoCs (RTL8197F).  The PHYs are shared by
+	  the on-chip EHCI/OHCI host controllers; PHY 1 can alternatively
+	  be routed to the DWC OTG device controller.  The driver handles
+	  the system controller power/reset bits and the indirect UTMI
+	  register access used for electrical tuning.
+
